  "vendor_website": "sipel.com.ar",
  "description": "Weighing and dual-cut filling module: gross, tare and net weight, status and task, key and command registers, cut settings",
  "revision": 1,
  "revised": "2026-11-15",
  "source": "SIPEL Apolo-PH, Manual v16b",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Manual Apolo-PH",
      "version": "v16b",
      "url": "https://www.sipel.com.ar/uploads/Apolo%20PH/Manual_Apolo_PH_v16b.pdf",
      "note": "Section 4, Modbus memory map",
      "accessed": "2026-11-15",
      "sha256": "71900c618b95abcca7adcd33e281ef5babf5a280f1078406f6438c941c2e6898"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU on RS-485, 19200 8N1, functions 03 (read) and 06 (write one register); write with length 1 only. The module also answers slave address 0.",
    "Reading and writing a register can mean different things: address 6 reads Status and Task, and is written with the Key; address 7 reads the last Command and the Result, and is written with the Command. Entries for both are listed.",
    "The manual's PLC example writes the key at address 7; the memory map writes it at 6 and the map is followed.",
    "Weights are 32-bit integers in two registers with no decimal point; the word order is not stated, high word first is assumed.",
    "Written from the manual (Spanish), not tested on a device."
  ],
  "protocol": "rtu",
  "unit_id": 1,
  "baudrate": 19200,
  "parity": "N",
  "databits": 8,
  "stopbits": 1,
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "big",
  "address_base": 0,
  "x_status": "official",
